The mod source code in this repository is released into the public domain
(CC0 1.0 Universal). Do what you want with it.

Bundled third-party libraries keep their own licenses:

- JAAD (net.sourceforge.jaad, com.tianscar.javasound:jaad) - public domain.
- MP3SPI (com.googlecode.soundlibs:mp3spi) - LGPL 2.1+ / JavaZoom license.
- JLayer (com.googlecode.soundlibs:jlayer) - LGPL 2.1+.
- Tritonus Share (com.googlecode.soundlibs:tritonus-share) - LGPL 2.1+.

See the source distributions of those libraries for the full license texts.
Modifying and redistributing them must comply with their licenses.
